words="Agar tumhara Mussoorie | jaane ka plan hai na, | thoda sa ruk jao, | usse thodi si aage | jagah ek Kanatal hai, | wahan chalte hain, | view_bhi itna tagda aayega | ki Mussoorie bhool jaoge. | Humne launch kiya ek | Delhi se Kanatal ka | weekend trip, | sirf 6,800 mein. | Friday raat 10 baje | Delhi se niklenge | aur raaste mein | bahut saari games, | masti aur full enjoy | karne wale hain. | Subah Kanatal pahunchkar | naashta, aur uske baad | seedha Surkanda Devi Temple jaayenge, | jahan_se poora | Himalaya ka view dikhta hai, | uske baad bahut saara | adventure karenge. | Zipline, sky roller, | sky cycling | aur bahut kuch, | jo bhi saari cheezein | package mein include rahengi. | Uske baad Tehri Lake par | banana ride kar sakte hain, | aur uske baad Delhi wapsi. | Aur poore trip pe | ek trip captain | aap ke saath rahega, | jo aapko ek doosre se | connect rakhega, | aur koi dikkat bhi | nahi hone dega. | Details chahiye toh | neeche Book_Now pe click karo, | seedha WhatsApp mein | baat karte hain."
